Add new flag `-unittest-roots`

Besides the existing `-unittest` flag dmd now also takes the
accompanying flag `-unittest-roots`. When passed, only the unittests
placed in the (root) source files `X`... being explicitly passed to
the call to dmd are processed like when `-unittest` is passed. All
other unittests placed in (non-root) modules not present in `X` that
are (transitively) imported in `X` source files (when `-i` is passed)
will not be processed.
